cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HandoffX, please cite it as below."
title: "HandoffX: auditable continue/retry/human/stop decision support for autonomous agents under uncertainty"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Pratik653
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pratik653/HandoffX"
keywords:
  - human-in-the-loop
  - autonomous agents
  - Bayesian decision-making
  - escalation
  - learning to defer
abstract: >-
  Research software and synthetic benchmark for deciding whether an autonomous
  agent should continue, retry, request human assistance or stop. Exact
  finite-horizon planning with latent persistent failure modes, cross-episode
  Bayesian calibration of supplied success estimates and a conservative
  posterior gate. Evidence is from synthetic simulations only.
